# Sprint 8: OSI Architecture Alignment & Modularization Implementation Plan

## Overview
This sprint focuses on refactoring the current platform codebase to align with the OSI (Open Systems Interconnection) reference framework. The goal is to modularize the system (specifically chat, game logic, auth, and WebSockets) into distinct layers to improve message reliability, streamline troubleshooting, and enforce strict boundaries.

